        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>数学笔记 - 二次函数</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #ddd;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdfaf3;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 20px 20px;\n    border: 1px solid #d8cfc0;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);\n    padding: 15px 20px 20px 20px;\n  }\n  .header-row {\n    display: flex;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .header-cell {\n    flex: 1;\n    border-right: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .header-cell:last-child { border-right: none; }\n  .header-cell .en { font-size: 9px; color: #666; margin-left: 3px; }\n\n  .content {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .purple { color: #6a3fb5; }\n  .blue { color: #2255cc; }\n  .red { color: #d43a3a; }\n  .redbold { color: #d43a3a; font-weight: bold; font-size: 17px; }\n  .green { color: #2a8f3c; }\n\n  .parabola-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin: 10px 0 20px 20px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 110px;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .placeholder svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }\n  .placeholder .cap {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #999;\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: -12px;\n    width: 100%;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .summary-divider {\n    border-top: 1px dashed #999;\n    margin: 15px 0 8px 0;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .summary-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -10px;\n    left: 0;\n    background: #fdfaf3;\n    padding: 0 6px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #666;\n  }\n\n  .side-tabs {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 30px;\n    right: -34px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .tab-header {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #666;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    height: 40px;\n  }\n  .tab {\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 15px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 15px;\n    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\n  }\n\n  .indent { margin-left: 20px; }\n  .indent2 { margin-left: 40px; }\n  .small-note {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #444;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header-row\">\n    <div class=\"header-cell\">Keywords <span class=\"en\">关键词</span></div>\n    <div class=\"header-cell\">Notes <span class=\"en\">笔记</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"purple\">\n      2. 再定轴;括号内取0(顶点式); y=-<span style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #6a3fb5;\">b</span>/2a (一般式)\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"parabola-row\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 130 110\">\n          <path d=\"M20,20 Q65,120 110,20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6a3fb5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"cap\">[Diagram: downward-ish parabola]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 130 110\">\n          <path d=\"M20,90 Q65,-10 110,90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3a3aa0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"cap\">[Diagram: upward parabola]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"purple\" style=\"margin-top:-10px;\">\n      y=-2(x+1)²-3\n      <span class=\"blue\" style=\"margin-left:110px;\">y=2x²-3x+3</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <br>\n    <div class=\"redbold\">例题精讲</div>\n\n    <div class=\"blue\">\n      例1(1) 2020 福建厦门月考\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blue\">\n      由二次函数y=2(x-3)²+1, 可知(<span class=\"red\">B</span>)\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blue\">\n      A. 其图象的开口向下. <span class=\"red\">x a=2&gt;0 向上</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blue\">\n      B. 其图象的顶点坐标为(3,1)\n      <span class=\"red small-note\">对称x=3 (3,1)</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blue\">\n      C. 其图象的对称轴为直线x=3 . <span class=\"red\">X</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blue\">\n      D. 当x&lt;3时, y随x的增大而增大. <span class=\"red\">x</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"indent2 red\">减小</div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:60px;height:60px;margin-left:280px;margin-top:-20px;\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n        <path d=\"M10,50 Q30,0 50,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d43a3a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <br>\n    <div class=\"blue\">例1(2)</div>\n\n    <div class=\"summary-divider\">\n      <span class=\"summary-label\">Summary <span style=\"color:#999;\">总结</span></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blue\">\n      对于二次函数y=x²-2x-1, 下列说法不正确的是(<span class=\"red\">D</span>)\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blue\">\n      A. 函数图象的对称轴是直线x=1\n      <span class=\"red small-note\">对称=-2/2=1</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blue\">\n      B. 函数图象的顶点坐标为(1,-2)\n      <span class=\"red small-note\">(1,-2)</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"red indent2\">\n      当x=1时, y=1-2-1=-2\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"tab-header\">Contents <span style=\"color:#999;\">目录</span></div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" style=\"background:#7f9fd6;\">1</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" style=\"background:#7a9bd4;\">2</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" style=\"background:#7597d1;\">3</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" style=\"background:#7093cf;\">4</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" style=\"background:#6b8fcc;\">5</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" style=\"background:#668bca;\"